accurate_rq_snippets_must_parse {
    Every site snippet that demonstrates accurate reqlan must parse against the Langium grammar.
    In scope: language-"rq" blocks (landing syntax pairs, the example slice, the hero snippet, showcase `.rq` blocks).
    Out of scope: ts / md / py snippets that only show `rq:` comment links.
    Invalid-on-purpose samples must not be labelled language-"rq".
    Enforced by tests plus the content parse gate in ["../../site/scripts/validate-showcase-rq.mts"].
    Showcases are a subset per [every_rq_block_must_parse] / [phase_1_parse_gate].
    @status done
    @implementation (
        ["../../site/src/content/parse-rq-snippet.ts"]
        ["../../site/src/content/accurate-rq-snippets.ts"]
